| GPUProbe [-o file]: what the GPU gives programs through riscos-mesa, for
| RISC3D's setup window: for OpenGL, OpenGL ES (its highest) and OpenGL ES
| 1.1, the route (RISC3D or software), GL_VERSION, GL_RENDERER, the shading
| language, the largest texture and the extensions, as "key: value" lines
| (see !Help). Start it as a task of its own (Wimp_StartTask), as an ELF
| program it needs its own slot. RISC3D decides GPU or software, as for
| every program.
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then IfThere Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot Then Run Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot
If "<MesaLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Run <Obey$Dir>.!Boot
Set gpuprobe$LD$Env "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/MesaLibs:"
WimpSlot -min 16000K -max 16000K
Run <Obey$Dir>.bin.gpuprobe %*0
